@CajunLyrics.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7156

### Get Cajun Lyrics by artist and title
GET {{CajunLyrics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Lyrics/lyric?artist=Zachary%20Richard&title=Travailler%20C%27est%20Trop%20Dur
Accept: application/json

### Get Cajun Lyrics with language filter
GET {{CajunLyrics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Lyrics/lyric?artist=Zachary%20Richard&title=Travailler%20C%27est%20Trop%20Dur&language=fr_LA
Accept: application/json

### Get OpenAPI specification
GET {{CajunLyrics.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###
